    "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />If <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>g</mtext> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mtext>x</mtext> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup> <mtext>f</mtext> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mrow> <mi>sin</mi><mtext>x</mtext></mrow> </mfenced><mo>.</mo><mi>cos</mi><mtext>x</mtext></mrow> </math><br />For <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> to be increasing<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>"
